WEBVTT

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.436
Just think of yourself
as an investor in food,

00:05:31.343 --> 00:05:35.135
where your purchasing power helps create
a more equitable society for everyone.

00:05:36.062 --> 00:05:37.229
Oh!

00:05:37.788 --> 00:05:39.225
Almost forgot step three,

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.744
which may surprise you:

00:05:43.595 --> 00:05:45.875
shop at your local farmers markets.

00:05:45.899 --> 00:05:46.969
(Laughter)

00:05:46.993 --> 00:05:48.051
Thank you.

00:05:48.075 --> 00:05:52.613
(Applause)